title: "AgMEQ Automated Mass Tracker"
abstract: >-
  A low-cost Raspberry Pi system that logs the mass of a RADWAG WTC 2000
  balance every 15 minutes, used to track moisture uptake and loss of dried
  maize stalks during conditioning.
type: software
